WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.956
Before a single article was

2
00:00:01.956 --> 00:00:03.971
written, the Assembly agreed on

3
00:00:03.971 --> 00:00:04.926
its goals.

4
00:00:04.926 --> 00:00:07.498
In the Objectives Resolution.

5
00:00:07.858 --> 00:00:09.830
Nehru moved it on the

6
00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:12.003
thirteenth of December,

7
00:00:12.003 --> 00:00:14.401
1946. It was adopted on

8
00:00:14.401 --> 00:00:17.027
the twenty-second of January,

9
00:00:17.027 --> 00:00:18.035
1947.

10
00:00:18.371 --> 00:00:20.209
It promised an independent,

11
00:00:20.209 --> 00:00:21.862
sovereign republic,

12
00:00:21.862 --> 00:00:22.778
with social,

13
00:00:22.778 --> 00:00:24.876
economic and political justice,

14
00:00:24.876 --> 00:00:26.761
liberty and equality.

15
00:00:27.456 --> 00:00:29.825
The other big influence was

16
00:00:29.825 --> 00:00:32.389
the Government of India Act,

17
00:00:32.389 --> 00:00:34.725
1935. Much of the administrative

18
00:00:34.725 --> 00:00:36.662
structure came from it.

19
00:00:36.977 --> 00:00:38.154
Your turn.

20
00:00:38.154 --> 00:00:39.777
Who moved it?
